# Map Provider API Keys
# Add your API keys below to enable enhanced features
# The application will automatically use the best available provider

# Google Maps API (for Google Photorealistic 3D Tiles - when available)
# Get your key at: https://developers.google.com/maps
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_key_here

# Cesium Ion (for 3D terrain and high-resolution imagery)
# Get your free token at: https://cesium.com/ion/
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=your_cesium_ion_token_here

# Bing Maps (for aerial imagery)
# Get your free key at: https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/maps
VITE_BING_MAPS_API_KEY=your_key_here

# MapTiler (alternative satellite imagery)
# Get your free API key at: https://www.maptiler.com/cloud/
VITE_MAPTILER_API_KEY=your_maptiler_api_key_here

# Mapbox (alternative satellite imagery)
# Get your API key at: https://www.mapbox.com/
VITE_MAPBOX_API_KEY=your_mapbox_api_key_here

# NOTE: The application works WITHOUT any API keys using free providers:
# - ArcGIS World Imagery (default)
# - OpenStreetMap
# - NASA Blue Marble (fallback)
